  "description": {
    "about": {
      "items": [
        {
          "items": [
            "<br>(The Wall Street residential beach entrance is not subject to “customary use restrictions”. You can take beach chairs to use or there is a vendor for beach chair set-up, Additionally, you can walk east for about a mile with ease.)<br><br>This property is a beautiful three story house that looks directly to the beach. It was built in 2013.<br><br>The first floor includes two bedrooms with queen size beds that share a Jack & Jill bath. Each bedroom has patio access. <br><br>The second floor includes a large open floor plan that contains the kitchen, living and dining room, laundry room, and one bedroom, (queen bed), and a full bath. All of these rooms look directly to the beach and have access to a large screened porch for guests to enjoy for entertaining or just spending time with family. Views from the screen porch are fantastic!<br><br>The third floor has the master bedroom suite with a king bed and bath. This floor also has a screened porch for guests to relax and enjoy watching the evening sunset. <br><br>The house also includes: <br>Expanded Cable with HDTV, Wireless Internet, and DVD players as well as a well-stocked kitchen.<br><br>Please inquire with any questions.<br><br>**During the summer months, we offer Saturday to Saturday weekly stays**<br><br>**There is a security camera on the left corner of the house that looks toward the driveway**",
            "Our prices include all fees. No hidden fees."
          ],
          "title": "BOOK NOW for SPRING/SUMMER 2026!!\n4-5 minute walk to beach!"
