        "label": "Excellent",
        "locale": "en_US",
        "rating": 10,
        "text": "This is a very comfortable house and so close to the beach entrance it was easy to get to the beach with a really short walk. The kitchen has everything you want and they even have beach chairs for your use. With 3 Queens and a King bed it was just right for our group. We definitely recommend this house.",
