        "label": "Excellent",
        "locale": "en_US",
        "rating": 10,
        "text": "Beautiful setting. Easy access to the beach. Nice house. Well maintained. Love the large screened porch and the quiet porch off the master suite. We enjoyed watching and hearing the songbirds that live in the scrub oaks and bushes in the back as well. Lots of construction going on everywhere in Panama City Beach. We are already looking forward to our next beach vacation. Thank you.",
